{"step_index":297,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-29T13:35:21Z","input_tokens":2423,"cache_read_tokens":120079,"output_tokens":1892,"thinking":"Observed the current state of the database, confirming the model's predictions and database interaction. Moving to examine the FastAPI API endpoints, specifically the health endpoint to verify system status and database connectivity.\n\n\nReviewing the data access points, I see several key capabilities: dashboard analytics to assess model performance and risk trends, a review queue endpoint enabling filtering and sorting of cases, and a transaction details endpoint for in-depth investigation. There is also a real-time prediction endpoint for scoring individual transactions, and a counterfactual simulation endpoint to test scenarios. These endpoints cover the core functionalities expected of a fraud detection system.\n\n\nAnalyzing additional endpoints reveals counterfactual simulation, transaction timeline replay, and behavioral change detection capabilities. These features enable scenario analysis, historical context, and deviation identification. Further investigation focuses on the network graph and feedback endpoints, which provide relationship visualizations and investigator decision tracking respectively.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"\"\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nFraudLens AI - Pydantic Request & Response Schemas\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\nfrom typing import List, Dict, Any, Optional\\nfrom pydantic import BaseModel, Field\\n\\nclass TransactionPayload(BaseModel):\\n    transaction_id: str = Field(..., example=\\\"TXN-NEW-9001\\\")\\n    account_id: str = Field(..., example=\\\"ACC-1045\\\")\\n    amount: float = Field(..., gt=0, example=450.00)\\n    currency: str = Field(default=\\\"USD\\\", example=\\\"USD\\\")\\n    merchant_id: Optional[str] = Field(default=\\\"MER-GEN-100\\\", example=\\\"MER-ELE-105\\\")\\n    merchant_category: str = Field(default=\\\"grocery\\\", example=\\\"electronics\\\")\\n    device_id: Optional[str] = Field(default=\\\"DEV-DEFAULT\\\", example=\\\"DEV-ANOM-99\\\")\\n    ip_address: Optional[str] = Field(default=\\\"198.51.100.1\\\", example=\\\"203.0.113.199\\\")\\n    location_country: Optional[str] = Field(default=\\\"US\\\", example=\\\"US\\\")\\n    account_age_days: Optional[int] = Field(default=90, example=120)\\n    failed_attempts_last_24h: Optional[int] = Field(default=0, example=2)\\n    timestamp: Optional[str] = None\\n\\nclass PredictionResponse(BaseModel):\\n    transaction_id: str\\n    risk_score: float\\n    calibrated_probability: float\\n    baseline_probability: float\\n    triage_category: str\\n    uncertainty_indicator: float\\n    review_priority: float\\n    recommended_action: str\\n    model_version: str\\n    feature_contributions: List[Dict[str, Any]]\\n    raw_features: Dict[str, Any]\\n\\nclass CounterfactualRequest(BaseModel):\\n    transaction_id: str\\n    modified_amount: Optional[float] = None\\n    modified_device_id: Optional[str] = None\\n    modified_merchant_category: Optional[str] = None\\n    modified_failed_attempts: Optional[int] = None\\n    modified_country: Optional[str] = None\\n\\nclass CounterfactualResponse(BaseModel):\\n    transaction_id: str\\n    model_version: str\\n    original_risk_score: float\\n    modified_risk_score: float\\n    risk_score_delta: float\\n    original_category: str\\n    modified_category: str\\n    changed_inputs: Dict[str, Any]\\n    interpretability_warning: str\\n\\ncl\n<truncated 389 bytes>","Overwrite":"true","Path":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\S Nandhakumar\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\fraudlens-ai\\\\backend\\\\app\\\\schemas\\\\transactions.py\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
